## 4. Summary of Changes Requiring Action Before Gate 5

| Module | Change required |
|---|---|
| FVG Engine, Order Block Engine, Breaker Block Engine, MSS Engine, Liquidity Hierarchy Engine | Adopt instance-versioned emission (Section 1) instead of in-place status mutation |
| Institutional Event Log | Log every instance emission including supersessions (already its job — no structural change, just confirms it captures `supersedes`) |
| Confidence Scoring Engine | Emit structured `factors[]` instead of free-form `scoreBreakdown{}` |
| Trade Rating Engine | Add `confidenceScoreInstanceId` reference field |
| **All modules** | Optionally emit `HealthPing` telemetry (Section 2) |
| **New:** Engine Health Monitor | Build as module 14, Tier 3, periodic |

None of these modules have passed Gate 5 yet, so every change above is free to apply now at zero re-freeze cost — this is the last point at which that's true.
